The market price of our common stock historically has experienced and may continue to experience significant price fluctuations similar to those
experienced by the broader stock market in recent years. In addition, the price of our common stock may fluctuate significantly in response to various factors,
including:
• actual or anticipated fluctuations in our results of operations;
• announcements by us or our competitors of significant business developments, changes in customer relationships, acquisitions, or expansion plans;
• changes in the prices of products we sell;
• involvement in litigation;
• our sale of common stock or other securities in the future;
